### Login as admin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "admin@deskbooking.local", "password": "admin123"}

### Register user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "john@example.com", "password": "secret123", "fullName": "John Doe"}

### Offices (paste token)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/offices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Free desks for a day
GET http://localhost:8080/api/desks/available?officeId=1&date=2026-10-20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Book a desk
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"deskId": 1, "date": "2026-10-20"}

### My bookings
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/my
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
